  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Assistance for Vulnerable Populations in the States of Bol&#xed;var and Amazonas, Venezuela</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Based on lessons learned and achievements of the previous BHA funded project, this intervention aims to improve (1) access to quality healthcare and health-related information, and (2) awareness on protection risks and assistance pathways and provide direct assistance to those at risk of violence, abuse and/or exploitation. 
 
Target population: 
Vulnerable communities in Venezuelan states of Amazonas and Bolivar.</narrative>
  </description>
